OL,3,GNEWSAMore online disruption as cables
OL,4,Aare stolen - again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been further disruption to
OL,7,Fonline services across Bedfordshire
OL,8,Fafter more copper cables were stolen.
OL,10,FBedfordshire Police said it was
OL,11,Finvestigating after receiving reports
OL,12,Fof criminal damage on Luton Road, near
OL,13,FToddington at about 11:30 GMT on 5
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FThe infrastructure provider Openreach
OL,17,Fsaid there was another theft six days
OL,18,Flater on Wednesday and, as a result, a
OL,19,Froad closure would be in place until 16
OL,20,FNovember, including weekend working.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
